    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61361" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωπᾱΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αΐδος</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κωπᾴς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾷδος, ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>near Copae</i> (in Boeotia),
				ἡ K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνη</span> Lake <u>Copais</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.2.27
			</span></i>; ἡ K. alone, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.207d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχέλεις Κωπαΐδες</span> eels <i>from
				Lake C.</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				880
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κωπᾷδ᾽ ἔγχελυν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				962
			</span></i>: without Subst., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κωπᾴδων σπυρίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pax</u>
					1005
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κωπᾴδων ἁπαλῶν τεμάχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Stratt.
					44
				</span></i>
			.</div>
